1
00:00:00,151 --> 00:00:04,401
(Penny:)That's why I work at The Cheesecake
Factory. I'm holding out for the right part.

2
00:00:08,618 --> 00:00:12,408
(Leonard:)Alicia, what do you want as your default
setting for DVDs, 5. 1 Dolby or DTS?

3
00:00:13,081 --> 00:00:15,081
(Alicia:)Whatever you think is best, cutie.

4
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:16,790
[GIGGLES]

5
00:00:18,503 --> 00:00:21,423
Well, DTS has more low-end...

6
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:24,259
...so okay.

7
00:00:26,427 --> 00:00:30,927
Hey, guys, you will really appreciate this.
I read the best science joke on the Internet.

8
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,850
(Penny:)Alicia, you won't get it,
but it's right up their alley.

9
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:37,270
(Penny:)Anyway, so this physicist goes
into an ice cream parlor every week...

10
00:00:37,438 --> 00:00:39,438
(Penny:)...orders an ice cream sundae
for himself...

11
00:00:39,649 --> 00:00:41,939
...and offers one to the empty stool
next to him.

12
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:44,950
This goes on until the owner
asks him what he's doing.

13
00:00:45,113 --> 00:00:47,493
The man says, "Well, I'm a physicist...

14
00:00:47,699 --> 00:00:51,119
(Penny:)...and quantum mechanics teaches us...

15
00:00:52,161 --> 00:00:54,791
(Penny:)...that it is possible
for the matter above this stool...

16
00:00:54,997 --> 00:00:57,287
(Penny:)...to spontaneously turn
into a beautiful woman...

17
00:00:57,458 --> 00:01:00,018
(Penny:)...who might accept my offer
and fall in love."

